  "summary": "GREENWICH, Conn., March 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Oxford Lane Capital Corp. (Nasdaq GS: OXLC, OXLCP, OXLCL, OXLCO, OXLCZ, OXLCN, OXLCI and OXLCG) (the “Company”) today announced that it has priced an underwritten public offering of 2,400,000 shares of its newly designated 8.25% Series 2031 Term",
